      "updated_at": "2026-08-02T10:11:19Z",
      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/6\n\n- **Status:** ingame\n- **Release:** v0.1.6\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite (Adreno 830, Android 16)\n- **Driver:** Turnip gen8 v2 (Mesa 26.2.0-devel, git-7fdde2f8f8) — APK-bundled release gen8-v2\n- **Evidence commit:** `0f55fe15340b15109796f391249f067ddf67e5c6`\n\nBoots from the title screen through the opening cutscene into controllable third-person gameplay in the opening Ashina Reservoir area, with HUD rendering (action and item prompts). No crashes during the session; performance is variable (cutscenes reach 60 FPS, the reservoir area runs roughly 19-30 FPS with dips to ~12 FPS). Full-game completion was not verified, so status is ingame.\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice — v0.1.6 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/0f55fe15340b15109796f391249f067ddf67e5c6/assets/CUSA13801/20260802T100912Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v2-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice — v0.1.6 — ingame](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/0f55fe15340b15109796f391249f067ddf67e5c6/assets/CUSA13801/20260802T100912Z-v0-1-6-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v2-26-2-0-devel/screenshots/02.webp)\n",
